# The fast gates, on everything. No lint-staged: these four total about
# five seconds on this repo, which is less than the machinery to run
# them on only the staged files would cost to maintain. Revisit if the
# suite grows.
#
# format:check rather than `pnpm format`: a hook that rewrites files
# mid-commit leaves them unstaged, so the commit ships the unformatted
# version anyway. Failing and telling you to run `pnpm format` is honest.
pnpm typecheck
pnpm lint
pnpm format:check
pnpm test
